ueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_48":251},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_24":253,"_31":42,"_26":254,"_36":255,"_45":-7,"_11":256,"_46":257},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_48":258},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_24":260,"_31":42,"_26":261,"_36":262,"_45":-7,"_11":263,"_46":264},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_48":265},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_24":267,"_31":42,"_26":268,"_36":269,"_45":-7,"_11":270,"_46":271},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_48":272},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_24":274,"_31":42,"_26":275,"_36":276,"_45":-7,"_11":277,"_46":278},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_48":279},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_183":282},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" heig